<title>INDIA: India sets 10-bln-rupee bond auction for Feb 20.</title>
<headline>India sets 10-bln-rupee bond auction for Feb 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian Finance Ministry announced on Thursday the auction of 10 billion rupees' worth of 10-year government bonds on February 20.</p>
</text>
